Lexer for the Nova Programming Language
-------------------------------------------------------------------------
More documentation in the `docs/` folder
Build with:

  g++ -std=c++20 -Isrc src/main.cpp src/lexer.cpp src/dfa.cpp -o novac.exe
  ./novac.exe ./examples/test_program.nova

Running it with no arguments just does a quick sanity check on a hardcoded
snippet and prints how many tokens it found.

Find token specification an keywords in TOKENS file

Find the transition table writeup in DFA, the actual generated table in
dfa_table.csv, and sample scanner output in sample_output.txt
